  "goodToKnow": "Veralten means to become outdated or obsolete: Wissen veraltet schnell. It's mostly used as the participle veraltet (outdated): veraltete Technik, eine veraltete Ansicht. Dictionaries like the Duden mark old words as veraltet (obsolete) or veraltend (becoming obsolete), such as Fräulein. The opposite is aktuell or zeitgemäß. With sein: ist veraltet."
